


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_914eac67:



    voice "2FU_1169"
    fumi "「我回来……呀！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_e853eb13:


    "本该空无一人的玄关却有人出现，文被吓得发出了叫声。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_80cd4ab5:


    "平常的话这个时间已经是锁上门的了，不过今天则是联络了祥子让她开好门。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_491588d0:



    voice "2RI_1555"
    rin "「……欢迎回来」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_35882037:


    "玄关台阶处一个人影缓缓地站了起来。是伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_53c9c5a0:



    voice "2FU_1170"
    fumi "「伦，难道你一直在这等我吗？玄关这里应该很冷的吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_292ebfdf:



    voice "2RI_1556"
    rin "「没事。因为我想尽早见到文」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_68b8ea51:


    "伦轻描淡写的话语也难以掩盖她此时的安心感。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_e78782ec:



    voice "2FU_1171"
    fumi "「抱歉啊。比预料中要晚了点」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_c7bdf839:



    voice "2RI_1557"
    rin "「你给个电话我就可以去接你的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_0e1292c7:



    voice "2FU_1172"
    fumi "「忘记充电了结果意识到的时候手机已经没电了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_1379be01:



    voice "2RI_1558"
    rin "「这样吗。然后，呃，那个……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_803e57ec:



    voice "2SA_0857"
    sachiko "「啊，文回来了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_a864d438:



    voice "2HI_1555"
    hina "「欢迎回来」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_ed44a407:


    "宿管室的门被打开后阳菜和祥子从里面走了出来。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_9f2b9660:


    "顺带一提圣夜子已经在房间里睡了。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_82ae6f33:



    voice "2FU_1173"
    fumi "「我回来了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_9fbbc65b:



    voice "2SA_0858"
    sachiko "「今天你和事务所的人见面了吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_92de9d0e:



    voice "2HI_1556"
    hina "「到头来，你还是要去参加那个试镜吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_232801d2:



    voice "2RI_1559"
    rin "「啊，哦，对，我也想问那个！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_b9c9b2bc:



    voice "2FU_1174"
    fumi "「呃……暂时还没有下决定」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_24c245f0:



    voice "2RI_1560"
    rin "「怎么回事？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_43e70877:



    voice "2FU_1175"
    fumi "「虽然我再度拒绝他们的邀请了，可他们还是没多少退让的意思。结果就变成日后再作最终决定了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_5d6c84b3:


    "一脸疲惫的文叹了一口气。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_316ac709:



    voice "2RI_1561"
    rin "「真烦人啊。难不成是间可疑的事务所」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_e6cb0e73:



    voice "2HI_1557"
    hina "「那事务所很出名的哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_54d67960:



    voice "2RI_1562"
    rin "「出名不意味着就能让人放心啊！要知道之前都有像那样恶劣的艺人在嘛！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_6faab68a:



    voice "2SA_0859"
    sachiko "「有拿到名片吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_daf3a0dc:



    voice "2FU_1176"
    fumi "「啊，姑且是拿了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_eb5d101a:


    "文把名片从钱包里取了出来并递给祥子看了看。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_61deb42d:



    voice "2SA_0860"
    sachiko "「我瞅瞅……喔，这不是社长的名片嘛。就是说今天跟社长直接见面咯？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_fa36b55d:



    voice "2FU_1177"
    fumi "「好像是那么一回事」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_9fb10e3e:



    voice "2HI_1558"
    hina "「之前社长也直接打来过电话，看来她是真的打算要招募浅生过去啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_22949624:



    voice "2SA_0861"
    sachiko "「这回还真的是相当中意你了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_4f616021:


    "表情变得十分阴沉的伦与兴致勃勃的阳菜和祥子两人形成了非常鲜明的对比。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_2b13c4c5:



    voice "2RI_1563"
    rin "「有听他们讲解工作的内容么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_c36e1462:



    voice "2FU_1178"
    fumi "「嗯，大致上听说过了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_0b179fe6:



    voice "2RI_1564"
    rin "「……应该没有什么下流的工作吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_c5e0e483:


    "胡思乱想的伦显得十分担心的样子。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_49dea761:



    voice "2FU_1179"
    fumi "「才、才没有啊，那种工作！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_0ff07acb:



    voice "2RI_1565"
    rin "「……泳装呢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_bf6ee45f:



    voice "2FU_1180"
    fumi "「啊，泳装的话好像有哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_327a301b:



    voice "2RI_1566"
    rin "「不——行——！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_5f4af9a8:



    voice "2SA_0862"
    sachiko "「真的吗！？如果有文的泳装写真集之类的那我绝对要买！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_fe92ed21:



    voice "2RI_1567"
    rin "「不准买！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_7968bf5a:



    voice "2SA_0863"
    sachiko "「在南国岛屿那耀眼的阳光之下，巨乳天然美少女将以健康的比基尼姿态热情洋溢地登场！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_2bb84507:



    voice "2RI_1568"
    rin "「夜晚在床上那妖艳成熟的表情也无比娇媚之类的我可绝对不能原谅！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_80b3ccfe:


    "没有说到那个程度啦。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_f798f858:



    voice "2FU_1181"
    fumi "「那个，说个不相关的事……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_7199dd4b:



    voice "2RI_1569"
    rin "「……什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_33aed16e:


    "文那难以启齿的语气让伦心中涌起了不好的预感。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_ecd6e090:



    voice "2FU_1182"
    fumi "「从这个周末起直到情人节为止我可能要从家里去上学了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_e90b8adc:



    voice "2RI_1570"
    rin "「诶！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_ec545e4f:



    voice "2HI_1559"
    hina "「是因为要到家里的店帮忙吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_c9720071:



    voice "2FU_1183"
    fumi "「是的。因为上了电视后来店的客人突然就变多了。然后家里人问我说，哪怕只有早上跟晚上都好，可不可以帮下忙」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_3d57c788:



    voice "2SA_0864"
    sachiko "「原来如此，我明白了。那样的话我帮你办理下手续吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_3c8508ed:



    voice "2FU_1184"
    fumi "「麻烦您了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_807df0f1:



    voice "2SA_0865"
    sachiko "「那倒是没关系的啦……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_c1affb70:



    voice "2RI_1571"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_ba9d0954:


    "伦因为太震惊而石化了。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_59d331ef:



    voice "2FU_1185"
    fumi "「伦，抱歉啊。只要一个星期就可以了哦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_8024193e:



    voice "2RI_1572"
    rin "「诶，啊，我、我、我没事啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_03_46c20b4b:


    "明显不像没事的样子呢。"
